    {
      "text": "在5GC网管V1.3版本中，下载实时告警的路径为：Alarm-->Active Alarm。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "chunk-8155920f16768dca1cb872d8",
          "quote": "路径：Alarm-->Active Alarm\n"
        },
        {
          "chunk_id": "chunk-0d555a667d8458f08194b6fa",
          "quote": "路径：Alarm-->Active Alarm\n"
        },
        {
